    <briefdescription>
<para>Structured diagnostic record for a process module incident. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Captures the complete context needed for incident triage:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>when it occurred (UTC timestamp)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>what class of failure it represents</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>which operation and input triggered it</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the error code from <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1process_1a1335b0d0c8ab9e0c3cb80e113314b9e7" kindref="member">ProcError</ref> enum</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>an actionable message for the operator</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="invariant"><para>All fields are immutable after construction. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
